      "widgets_values": [
        "7-second video, two shots with one hard cut at 4 seconds. Shot 1, 0 to 4 seconds: medium shot, static camera, warm afternoon daylight from a window, a young Dutch man in his early 20s with short dark hair and a plain grey hoodie sits on the edge of his bed in a small cozy bedroom, he pulls a new red and white vertically striped football shirt out of an open cardboard box and holds it up in front of him with both hands, his eyes fixed on the shirt, head turned slightly to the side, smiling proudly while he admires it, plain shirt with no logos and no text, soft rustling of packing paper. Shot 2, 4 to 7 seconds: the same bedroom, static camera, frontal view of an open white wardrobe, his hand in the grey hoodie sleeve hangs the same red and white vertically striped football shirt on a wooden hanger on the rail, it is the only shirt in the wardrobe, many empty hangers and lots of empty space around it, the hand leaves the frame and the shirt sways gently, soft clack of a hanger and quiet room ambience. Cinematic, desaturated cool colors, subtle film grain, soft natural light, smooth 24fps."
      ]
